Finally, after much much hacking, an ascension!! (Arent you proud of me!!)

Bruny the Valkyrie ascended in 3.1.1 after 63K turns.  Ending stats normal
(for a demigod :), 203/241 HP, -18 AC, ExpLvl 21, +7 Mjollnir (still
rustproof, but not blessed any more :( ), +5 Vorpal Blade.

I would have to say that the key to this character was the Wand 'o Wishing
I found in a level 3 shop :).  Four useable wishes got a Shield of
Reflection, GDSM, GOP, and speed boots (all blessed, erodeproof, +3, of
course).  Those pesky gnomes and dwarves in the mines never stood a chance
:-).

Now, I can move on to 3.1.3 on my Mac (since I figured out how to build it
in ThinkC 5)

PS - if anybody actually reads this, and plays on a Mac, I figured out how
